        "prompt": "$5x^{0} = 0$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "The 0 only applies to $x$, so $x^{0} = 1$ and the 5 stays. Correct: $5$",
          "worked": "The zero index applies only to $x$: $5x^0=5\\times1=5$ for $x\\ne0$.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 14
      },
      {
        "id": "index-t4-q9-b",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "b",
        "prompt": "$(7a)^{0} = 7$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "The brackets mean the 0 applies to everything inside. Correct: $1$",
          "worked": "The zero index applies to the whole bracket: $(7a)^0=1$ for $a\\ne0$.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 14
      },
