        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "The 0 applies only to $a$, so $a^{0} = 1$, then $3 \\times 1$. Correct: $3$",
          "worked": "The zero index applies only to $a$: $3a^0=3\\times1=3$ for $a\\ne0$.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 14
      },
